<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">steel-ingot</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

Iron folded with coal dust through many heats, producing a denser
metal used in advanced armors, shields, and high-quality weapons.

