  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 4)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> iron ingot (x3), coal dust (x1)

